msgstr "Giff hier den Puffer an, na den Du wesseln wullt (ALT+B)"

#: editor/mainwindow.cpp:294
msgid ""
"<h2>The File Overview Window</h2><p>The File Overview Window displays all "
"open dialogs.</p>"
